Package lists for the Artixy installer, one package per line, # for comments.
%init% is replaced by the target's init system (runit), so service packages
read like "networkmanager-%init%".

base.txt            always installed by basestrap
desktop.txt         every desktop
wm/<name>.txt       one per window manager (hyprland, i3, openbox, ...)
x11.txt             added when any X11 window manager is picked
apps/<name>.txt     the optional apps checklist
aur/<name>.txt      built from the AUR with yay (not checked by
                    tools/check-packages.sh, and a failure there only warns)

XLibre itself comes from the [xlibre-stable] repo (see ../pacman/) and is
installed by install/40-xlibre.sh, not from these lists.
